[{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010009_00_0010","text":"好，进展顺利……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010009_00_0020","text":"挺顺利的嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010010_00_0010","text":"状态上来了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010010_00_0020","text":"找到感觉了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010011_00_0010","text":"哼……还算可以吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010011_00_0020","text":"感觉不错……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010012_00_0010","text":"嘛，没点本事可不行啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010012_00_0020","text":"啊哈……直接甩开你们了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010013_00_0010","text":"哼……那不是当然的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010014_00_0010","text":"这感觉，爽爆了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010015_00_0010","text":"还得……再练更多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010016_00_0010","text":"啊啊——……！……好累……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010017_00_0010","text":"哈？你是说怪我咯……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010018_00_0010","text":"妈的……为什么会这样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010027_00_0010","text":"哈？莫名其妙……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010028_00_0010","text":"妈的……还能做得更好吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010029_00_0010","text":"不会就这么结束的吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010030_00_0010","text":"哈……这不是来劲了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010031_00_0010","text":"啊哈哈！全都给我毁掉算了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010032_00_0010","text":"一直想看的……这片景色……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010033_00_0010","text":"哈……烦死了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010034_00_0010","text":"说点什么啊，神明大人………………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010035_00_0010","text":"不够……就这样结束了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010036_00_0010","text":"嘛，也就这样吧……辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010037_00_0010","text":"哼……不错吧…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s70_26010038_00_0010","text":"这一刻……爽爆了……！"}]
